<title>UK: Bradford wool market sees more enquiry.</title>
<headline>Bradford wool market sees more enquiry.</headline>
<dateline>BRADFORD 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>More enquiry was noted at Bradford on Monday as the wool market began to return to normal post-holiday trading, traders said.</p>
<p>The most obvious change was seen from an improved call for deliveries from Continental customers now back at work, they added.</p>
<p>However, some UK traders said that UK buying had tailed off and that deliveries were not going out as well as recently.</p>
<p>--Stephen Grainger, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8074</p>
